77727687037340", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982488_177727690370673_9018747294772212908_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Xx_vjh0u2I4Q7kNvwEq13JH&_nc_oc=Adormb16vCGanSleRQTvaX18YdJXOjoS5wvkgd85UlrAB9NEA0i4GIL0sA1KqwNBCto&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT9sl5gB620cktPNa9ywJ87W2PtAYteE5Jfm-iYlK_etQ&oe=6AFB2C43"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "mini_video.png", "id": "145148237432263", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75458095_145148240765596_7795154181803167711_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4_4Rl3vO5aAQ7kNvwGifyLm&_nc_oc=Adr_SIULOR6rZhao10Aw-D0h-bGo73qFnTRaGxVVXJJhMnYeqnaURdRxFvGtYNU63a0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS-M5isRIn9i7AOA8D-xqkaZNMDLhnD3Hk7FRhnZgEcoQ&oe=6AFB2B2E"}, "display_name": "TripeaksDreamland VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Tripeaks Solitaire card game with beautiful graphics in VR!\n\nfeatures:\n- Full Oculus Quest/Quest 2 VR-Controller support\n- Three difficulties\n- Smooth graphics\n- online high scores\n- 150 levels with different layouts\n- 5 languages selectable (English, German, Spanish, Turkish, Polish)\n\nMp3 Dateien im Musik Ordner unter \"tripeaks\" ablegen.\n\nUse the Touch Thumbsticks to control the music:\nPress = Start/Stop\nUp = Volume Up\nDown = Volume Down\nRight = Next\nLeft = Previous", "short_description": "Tripeaks Solitaire card game with beautiful graphics and unique environment in VR!\n\nFull Oculus Quest/Quest 2 Controller support!\n\n150 different card layouts!"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "132448825394132", "locale": "de_DE", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "TripeaksDreamland VR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Tripeaks Solitaire Kartenspiel mit wundersch\u00f6nen Grafiken in VR!\n\nFeatures:\